# Discharge Patient Flow

## 0. Overview

This file is the direct Discharge flow source of truth for HOSSPI HMS. Discharge orchestrates **multi-step inpatient clearance** on the **IPD admission / encounter** — it does not create parallel records. Align with [`.cursor/flows/ipd-flow.mdc`](./ipd-flow.mdc), [`.cursor/flows/opd-flow.mdc`](./opd-flow.mdc), [`.cursor/flows/nursing-flow.mdc`](./nursing-flow.mdc), [`.cursor/flows/pharmacy-flow.mdc`](./pharmacy-flow.mdc), [`.cursor/flows/icu-flow.mdc`](./icu-flow.mdc), and [`.cursor/app-write-up.mdc`](../app-write-up.mdc).

## 1. Goal

Enable doctors, nurses, pharmacists, billers, and discharge coordinators to complete discharge planning, pending-order review, multi-party clearance, patient exit, bed release handoff, and encounter closure — without conflating OPD visit completion with IPD discharge.

### Central encounter rule

All clearance attaches to the **IPD admission**. OPD `DISCHARGED` ([opd-flow §3](./opd-flow.mdc)) completes the **outpatient visit only** — handled in OPD flow, not this module.

---

## 2. Position in the Patient Journey

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    CARE[IPD care loop] --> PLAN[plan-discharge]
    PLAN --> PEND[Pending orders review]
    PEND --> DOC[Doctor summary]
    DOC --> PHARM[Pharmacy clearance]
    PHARM --> BILL[Billing clearance]
    BILL --> NURSE[Nursing clearance]
    NURSE --> EXIT[Patient exit]
    EXIT --> BED[Bed release → Housekeeping]
    BED --> FIN[finalize-discharge — DISCHARGED]
```

| Related flow | Discharge responsibility |
| ------------ | ------------------------ |
| [ipd-flow §10–§12](./ipd-flow.mdc) | Canonical discharge steps, statuses, backend stages |
| [ipd-flow §11](./ipd-flow.mdc) `DISCHARGE_PLANNED`, `DISCHARGED` | Queue filters and actions |
| [icu-flow §12](./icu-flow.mdc) | ICU signals readiness only; end ICU stay before ward exit if still active |
| [nursing-flow §3 step 8](./nursing-flow.mdc) | Nursing clearance step |
| [pharmacy-flow §4](./pharmacy-flow.mdc) | Take-home medicines clearance |
| [opd-flow §8](./opd-flow.mdc) | Do not conflate OPD completion with IPD discharge |

**Alternate exit:** in-hospital death uses **Mortuary** pathway — not standard discharge finalize ([app-write-up](../app-write-up.mdc) Mortuary row).

---

## 3. Step-by-Step Discharge Workflow

| Step | What Happens | Main Role | API / pattern |
| ---- | ------------ | --------- | ------------- |
| 1 | Doctor marks discharge planned | Doctor | `POST /ipd-flows/:id/plan-discharge` |
| 2 | System checks pending lab, radiology, procedure, medication, consult, nursing tasks | System | Read from encounter |
| 3 | Doctor confirms ignorable vs required pending items | Doctor | Discharge UI |
| 4 | Discharge summary, advice, follow-up prepared | Doctor | Summary API / IPD notes |
| 5 | Take-home medicines prepared | Pharmacy | [pharmacy-flow](./pharmacy-flow.mdc) |
| 6 | Final bill, balance, insurance closure | Billing | Billing workspace link |
| 7 | Nursing clearance and patient education | Nurse | [nursing-flow](./nursing-flow.mdc) |
| 8 | Patient exits; documents provided | Discharge desk | |
| 9 | Bed released for cleaning | Bed manager / System | `release-bed`; Housekeeping handoff |
| 10 | IPD encounter closed | System | `POST /ipd-flows/:id/finalize-discharge` |

---

## 4. Discharge Status Mapping

Map UI to [ipd-flow §12](./ipd-flow.mdc) recommended statuses:

| Status | Meaning |
| ------ | ------- |
| `Not Started` | No discharge plan |
| `Planned` | `DISCHARGE_PLANNED` stage |
| `Summary Pending` | Doctor summary incomplete |
| `Medication Pending` | Take-home meds not ready |
| `Billing Pending` | Financial clearance incomplete |
| `Nursing Clearance Pending` | Ward checklist incomplete |
| `Documents Ready` | All clearances complete |
| `Patient Exited` | Physical exit recorded |
| `Completed` | `DISCHARGED` / encounter closed |

**Rule:** Do not show “patient discharged” until IPD `DISCHARGED` stage ([icu-flow §12](./icu-flow.mdc) same rule).

---

## 5. Module Boundaries

| Own in Discharge | Do not duplicate |
| ---------------- | -------------- |
| Clearance orchestration UI, plan/finalize actions | Invoice/payment processing (Billing) |
| Pending-order visibility | Pharmacy dispensing (Pharmacy) |
| Discharge summary preparation coordination | Ward MAR and vitals (Nursing) |
| Bed release trigger after exit | Housekeeping task execution (Housekeeping) |

